        ceo:bevatObject <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/archeozoologie/id/boneinfo/occurrence/1098_1>,
            <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/archeozoologie/id/boneinfo/occurrence/1098_2>,
