        ceo:bevatObject <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/archeozoologie/id/boneinfo/occurrence/2117_1>,
            <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/archeozoologie/id/boneinfo/occurrence/2117_10>,
