        ceo:bevatObject <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/archeozoologie/id/boneinfo/occurrence/1765_1>,
            <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/archeozoologie/id/boneinfo/occurrence/1765_10>,
